  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Zuppa di pesce is a coastal Italian fish soup built on a "
          },
          {
            "type": "glossaryTooltip",
            "attrs": {
              "termSlug": "soffritto"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "soffritto"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " base with white wine and tinned tomatoes, thickened into something close to a light "
          },
          {
            "type": "glossaryTooltip",
            "attrs": {
              "termSlug": "brodetto"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "brodetto"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The seafood goes in at different stages because prawns cook much faster than squid. Serves 4 as a main course."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Serve with grilled or toasted bread rubbed with garlic to soak up the broth."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
